  {
    "index": 37,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[22]",
    "text": "1.  Abstract"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[23]",
    "text": "[Summarize the proposed system, the problem it solves, and the intended outcome. Describe the core design at a high level, including the main boundaries, dependencies, and guarantees. Keep this section concise enough that a reviewer can understand the proposal without reading the full document.]"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[24]",
    "text": "[Describe the workloads and constraints this design must support. Clarify what the proposal does not attempt to solve, the assumptions it relies on, and the most important operational or implementation boundaries.]"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[25]",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[26]",
    "text": "2.  Goals and Non-Goals"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[1]/w:tc[1]/w:p",
    "text": "Goals"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[1]/w:tc[2]/w:p",
    "text": "Non-goals"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[2]/w:tc[1]/w:p",
    "text": "[Goal 1: measurable outcome this design must achieve]"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[2]/w:tc[2]/w:p",
    "text": "[Non-goal 1: explicitly excluded capability or outcome]"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[1]/w:p",
    "text": "[Goal 2: reliability, scale, security, or user outcome]"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[2]/w:p",
    "text": "[Non-goal 2: adjacent problem deferred to a later phase]"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[4]/w:tc[1]/w:p",
    "text": "[Goal 3: required platform, policy, or operational capability]"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[4]/w:tc[2]/w:p",
    "text": "[Non-goal 3: unsupported workflow, audience, or interface]"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[5]/w:tc[1]/w:p",
    "text": "[Goal 4: rollout, reversibility, or blast-radius constraint]"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[3]/w:tr[5]/w:tc[2]/w:p",
    "text": "[Non-goal 4: guarantee the design cannot or will not provide]"
  },
  {
