    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[28]",
    "text": "3.  Background and Problem Statement"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[29]",
    "text": "[Describe the current state, the specific problem, and why the existing approach is no longer sufficient. Include relevant scale, reliability, security, cost, or developer-experience constraints, and explain the impact of leaving the problem unresolved.]"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[30]",
    "text": "[Explain the proposed system boundary and the major responsibilities on each side. Name the primary components, how they interact, and which inputs determine behavior. State the key design principle or invariant that should guide implementation and review.]"
  },
