    "index": 153,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[6]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[2]/w:p",
    "text": "[Describe the error, retryability, and side-effect behavior.]"
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "path": "/w:document/w:body/w:tbl[6]/w:tr[3]/w:tc[3]/w:p",
    "text": "[Explain why the failure mode is safe and observable.]"
